  "description": "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server binding for Orleans.Lattice. Exposes the cluster's transport-agnostic API facades (state, data, backup, auth, replication, treeadmin, and tenantadmin) as MCP tools over the official ModelContextProtocol SDK, with permission-aware discovery, an authenticated fail-closed credential bridge, and default-deny authorization. Per-facade modules are opt-in via Add*Tools helpers, including AddTenantAdminTools, and out-of-silo hosting is available via AddLatticeMcpRemote(...).",
